room test/flat
spawn 1700 544
frames 80
input
  # Thrown up-right, the ember stops on the room's right wall (face at 1888) in the air.
  0 U R toss
  # A jump, the air jump and the air dash spent, then teleport holding toward the wall.
  20..25 jump
  28 jump
  32 L dash
  50 R toss
  51..79 R
end
expect
  mark stopped 3..40 ember_x>=1887u
  at 28 event.air_jump=1
  at 32 event.dash=1
  at 50 event.teleport=1 event.wall_cling=1 state=wall air_jumps=1 air_dashes=1
end
